 2320 A:da20                                    ; FOR OTHER CALLS TO LINGET.
 2321 A:da20                                    ; 
 2322 A:da20                                    ; YOU CAN SEE THIS IS YOU FIRST PUT "BRK" IN $22D9,
 2323 A:da20                                    ; THEN TYPE "GO TO 437761".
